            "heading": "<p>About Sound Claw</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_BmRW3n": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I'm an engineer with a passion for both function and design. Besides creating the Sound Claw, I also run Giggletech, where I develop innovative products for VR. The Sound Claw is my latest venture, and I'm thrilled to share it with you. Thank you for taking the time to learn about it! Once there's enough demand, I plan to launch a dedicated website for the Sound Claw. Until then, happy riding!</p><p>Your support means a lot to me. If you like the Sound Claw, please share it with your friends and colleagues. As an indie developer, your help truly means the world.</p>"
          }
        },
